      "title": "迈出第一步·Ⅲ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "39904001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text": "《仲夏奇妙夜》第二批演员海选现场——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39904002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "第253号参选者，请你做一下自我介绍。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39904003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "徕卡",
          "text": "有请我的搭档登场！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39904004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "布鲁特",
          "text": "还不快献上你们的掌声！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39904005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "怎么是男人？你走错片场了，这里只招募女演员。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39904006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "布鲁特",
          "text": "什么？你在怀疑布鲁特先生的演技吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39904007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "徕卡",
          "text": "对巨星徕卡和布鲁特来说，扮演女性根本不是什么难题。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39904008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玉夏",
          "text": "槽点太多，已经无从谈起了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39904009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text": "此时，一辆机车风一样地冲了过来——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39904010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "藤林杏",
          "text": "前面的同学，快闪开！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39904011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "藤林杏",
          "text": "呀！！！小心——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39904012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "布鲁特",
          "text": "嗯？有什么奇怪的东西飞过来了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39904013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "徕卡",
          "text": "嘿，老伙计，我敢打赌这肯定是你的冷笑话，我不会上当的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39904014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "布鲁特",
          "text": "笨蛋，这个时候就别演了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39904015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "布鲁特",
          "text": "疼疼疼疼……布鲁特好疼！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39904016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "徕卡",
          "text": "竟然有人胆敢当着我的面伤害布鲁特，徕卡绝不允许！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39904017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "徕卡",
          "text": "喂，你撞伤了布鲁特，还不赶快道歉！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39904018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "藤林杏",
          "text": "奇怪，我为什么要对一个布偶道歉？而且你又没受伤。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39904019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "藤林杏",
          "text": "以后不要站在马路中央，很危险的，还好我及时踩住了刹车。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39904020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "徕卡",
          "text": "真是不可理喻，看来徕卡和布鲁特不得不出手教训教训你了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-970",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "clannad",
          "rowIds": [
            39904001,
